<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>PAYE tax bands for resident individuals, from 1 July 2023 (Kenya Revenue Authority; Finance Act 2023):</p><tabular border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Monthly taxable pay (Ksh)</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Rate</cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">First <m>24\,000</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>10\%</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Next <m>8333</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>25\%</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Next <m>467\,667</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>30\%</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Next <m>300\,000</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>32.5\%</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Above <m>800\,000</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>35\%</m></cell></row></tabular><p>Personal relief: Ksh <m>2400</m> a month, taken off the tax. PAYE is never negative.</p><p>Achieng's taxable pay is Ksh <m>{28\,500}</m> a month.</p><p>(a) Find the tax before relief.</p><p>Ksh <fillin characters="10" name="ans1"/>  </p><p>(b) Find the PAYE after personal relief of Ksh <m>2400</m>.</p><p>Ksh <fillin characters="10" name="ans2"/>  </p><p>Give each answer to the nearest shilling, or exactly in cents.</p></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>Each slice of pay is taxed at its own band's rate.</p><p>Split Ksh <m>{28\,500}</m> into the bands:</p><ul><li>first <m>{24\,000}</m> at <m>10\%</m>: <m>{2400}</m></li><li>next <m>{4500}</m> at <m>25\%</m>: <m>{1125}</m></li></ul><p>Tax before relief <m>= {3525}</m>.</p><p>(a) Tax before relief <m>= {3525}</m> shillings.</p><p>(b) PAYE <m>= {3525} - 2400 = {1125}</m> shillings.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p><m>3525.0</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>1125.0</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>